    "formula": "lim_(x arrow.r a) f(x)=f(a)",
    "text": "Continuity means the output at an input matches the height approached nearby. Three things are needed: a defined value, an existing two-sided limit, and agreement between them. A graph without a break illustrates this relationship.",
